# Phase 6: Project Testing Phase

## 1. Overview
The testing phase evaluates the **LegalEase - AI-Powered Legal Document Generator** to ensure output precision, functional stability, input validation, and reliable performance across key system components.

---

## 2. Types of Testing Performed

* **Unit Testing:** Validates individual backend API endpoints, document template rendering engines, and prompt construction modules.
* **Integration Testing:** Verifies seamless communication between the user interface, backend server, and the AI model/LLM API.
* **Functional Testing:** Ensures form inputs accurately translate into properly formatted legal document templates.
* **User Interface (UI) Testing:** Assesses form field responsiveness, error handling displays, and preview screen usability.

---

## 3. Test Cases & Execution Summary

| Test Case ID | Feature / Module | Test Scenario | Expected Result | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **TC-01** | User Input Form | Submitting empty required fields | Displays validation error messages | **PASS** |
| **TC-02** | AI Generator | Generating NDA template with valid inputs | Produces correctly structured document | **PASS** |
| **TC-03** | API Integration | API timeout or rate-limiting handling | Shows friendly error notification | **PASS** |
| **TC-04** | Export Module | Exporting generated legal document to PDF | PDF downloads with correct formatting | **PASS** |
| **TC-05** | UI Responsive | Rendering output preview on mobile view | UI resizes without content overflow | **PASS** |

---

## 4. Bug Identification & Resolution

* **Issue 1:** Formatting alignment shifts when exporting documents to PDF.
  * **Fix:** Adjusted CSS print/page-break styles prior to PDF conversion.
* **Issue 2:** API response timeout on complex template requests.
  * **Fix:** Implemented asynchronous handling and loading state indicators on the frontend.

---

## 5. Conclusion
All critical core functionalities have been tested and verified. The LegalEase generator accurately processes user parameters and delivers legal document outputs without system-level errors.
